OL,3,GNEWSAUnion accuses ferries agency of   
OL,4,Asabotaging Ferguson shipyard           
OL,6,FIn a letter to Transport Secretary     
OL,7,FStephen Flynn, the union urged         
OL,8,Fministers to "consider the position" of
OL,9,FHobbs and other board members and      
OL,10,Fclaimed CMAL was itself to blame for   
OL,11,Fmany of the yard's problems.           
OL,13,FCMAL said it had already made a        
OL,14,Fsignificant contribution in evidence to
OL,15,Fa Holyrood committee last week and had 
OL,16,Fnothing further to add.                
